# Uploads for the tend-web Vercel project, which deploys from web/ (docs/DEPLOY.md).
# Local env files never go up; Vercel builds with the project's own environment variables.
.env*
.next
node_modules
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.DS_Store
# Test output (end-to-end screenshots and traces) and stray keys never go up either.
test-results
playwright-report
*.pem
